  "_description": "Literature-curated gene fusion calls. Two jobs: supply a fusion status for cell lines the DepMap caller could not read (no RNA-seq), and add recurrent driver fusions that are documented in the literature but absent from the caller's output. Only recurrent, disease-defining or clinically actionable fusions are listed; private one-off fusions and normal immunoglobulin V-J rearrangements are deliberately excluded, since adding them would reproduce the noise the curated fusion axis exists to avoid.",
